# Never ship secrets or local junk to the public Space. The Dockerfile copies the whole
# folder and the upload script mirrors this list, so a stray .env can't reach the Space
# either way. Report 05 flagged this gap on 2026-10-13.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
creds*
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*_test.py
verify_fix.py
